SUMMARY:Holiday Dueling Pianos: Festive Favorites & Loud Singalongs!
DESCRIPTION:We’re thrilled to bring Dueling Pianos back to West Art for a
  special holiday celebration! Featuring two pianos\, fearless pianists\, a
 nd a room full of people calling the shots\, this high-energy\, wildly int
 eractive show is led by Love Me Duel—Mary and Devin Calderin\, a husband
 -and-wife duo who have been performing together since 2017. Joining Mary a
 nd Devin on stage is the wonderful Alex Wash\, dueling pianist extraordina
 ire with nearly two decades of experience in the business. Here’s how it
  works: you request the songs\, and our pianists will perform them on the 
 spot\, complete with clever quips\, playful banter\, and massive sing-alon
 gs. Think of it as a live concert where the audience chooses the entire se
 tlist in real time\, with extra holiday magic thrown in! From Christmas cl
 assics to seasonal favorites\, Billy Joel to Beyoncé\, Mariah Carey to Bi
 ng Crosby\, and everything in between\, no genre is off-limits! Guests can
  also include a tip with their requests to move songs up in the queue\, ad
 ding a fun\, playfully competitive twist to the night. Expect an evening f
 ull of festive fun and joyful chaos\, with singing\, clapping\, dancing\, 
 laughter\, and plenty of surprises along the way! Throughout the show\, ou
 r musicians may invite audience members up front or on stage for lighthear
 ted contests\, singalongs\, and special celebrations. Whether you're gathe
 ring with friends\, planning a holiday outing\, or simply looking for a fu
 n night out\, this is all about bringing people together through music\, l
 aughter\, and unforgettable memories. We're glad to offer seated general a
 dmission\, along with the option to reserve a four-person table up front i
 f you want to scale up the fun! Seating is limited\, and this special holi
 day show is expected to sell out—grab your tickets early to guarantee yo
